@startuml 02_data_flow
title SpeedLimit: data flow of one operational cycle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor Operator
[GUI / Scheduler] as GUI
[CycleOrchestrator] as Cycle
[InputGuardrail] as Guard
[Router] as Router
[FeatureBuilder] as Features
[Ensemble Predictor\n(10 neural networks)] as NN
[WeatherPolicy] as Weather
[AirQualityClient] as Air
[LLMManager] as LLM
[SpeedLimitDecider] as Decider
[ResearchAdvisor\n(advisory only)] as Research
cloud "Open-Meteo" as Api
cloud "Ollama" as Ollama
database "decisions.jsonl" as Log

Operator --> GUI : <<flow>> readings with units,\noverride
GUI --> Cycle : <<flow>> readings
Cycle --> Guard : <<flow>> readings
Guard --> Cycle : <<flow>> valid / rejected
Cycle --> Router : <<flow>> illuminance mlx,\nwater um, temperature C
Router --> Cycle : <<flow>> dark?, black ice?
Cycle --> Features : <<flow>> readings, 40/50/60/70 km/h
Features --> NN : <<flow>> one row per candidate
NN --> Weather : <<flow>> mean, 90% range,\nP(rate <= 1/h) per candidate
Weather --> Cycle : <<flow>> limit km/h, REQ1 flag,\nNN confidence + reasons
Cycle --> Air : <<flow>> request forecast
Air --> Api : <<flow>> coordinates
Api --> Air : <<flow>> PM10, NO2 ug/m3
Air --> Cycle : <<flow>> worst PM10, NO2
Cycle --> LLM : <<flow>> PM10, NO2
LLM --> Ollama : <<flow>> prompt, 3 seeds
Ollama --> LLM : <<flow>> 3 JSON replies
LLM --> Cycle : <<flow>> reduction km/h,\nLLM confidence + reasons
Cycle --> Decider : <<flow>> proposals
Decider --> Cycle : <<flow>> strictest limit, flags
Cycle --> Research : <<flow>> readings, PM10, NO2
Research --> Cycle : <<flow>> research limit km/h,\nevidence levels, sources
Cycle --> Log : <<flow>> audit record
Cycle --> GUI : <<flow>> limit km/h, reasons, confidence,\nresearch suggestion
GUI --> Operator : <<flow>> displayed limit,\nresearch beside it
@enduml
